        "message_id": "<010d019267ac927b-7669353e-eeb1-4fa7-8ffc-b848a4c3e154-000000@ca-central-1.amazonses.com>",
        "message_id_md5": "032fb0f9658e8402065e2e36abb530d2",
        "in_reply_to": null,
        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<p>Hooray, a new version of <a href=\"https://www.discourse.org\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.discourse.org\" target=\"_blank\">Discourse</a> is available!</p><p>Your version: 3.4.0.beta1-dev<br> New version: <strong>3.4.0.beta2</strong></p><ul>\n<li>\n<p>Update using our easy <strong><a href=\"http://forum.avicennaresearch.dev/admin/update\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"http://forum.avicennaresearch.dev/admin/update\" target=\"_blank\">one-click browser update</a></strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>See what’s new in the <a href=\"https://meta.discourse.org/tag/release-notes\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meta.discourse.org/tag/release-notes\" target=\"_blank\">release notes</a> or view the <a href=\"https://github.com/discourse/discourse/commits/main\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://github.com/discourse/discourse/commits/main\" target=\"_blank\">raw GitHub changelog</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Visit <a href=\"https://meta.discourse.org\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">meta.discourse.org</a> for news, discussion, and support for Discourse</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a name=\"release-notes-1\" href=\"http://#release-notes-1\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"http://#release-notes-1\" target=\"_blank\"></a>Release notes</h3>\n<p>Read about this release here:</p><p><a href=\"https://meta.discourse.org/t/3-4-0-beta2-better-pageview-metrics-multiple-category-moderator-groups-watch-chat-threads-and-more/329340\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://meta.discourse.org/t/3-4-0-beta2-better-pageview-metrics-multiple-category-moderator-groups-watch-chat-threads-and-more/329340</a></p><p>Please update your site as it includes security updates.</p><div> </div>",
